#: ../../source/compass.rst:4
msgid "The compass"
msgstr "指南针"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:12
msgid "The Diátaxis map of documentation types"
msgstr "Diátaxis 文档类型地图"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:12
msgid ""
"The map is defined by two axes that divide it into four quadrants. Above and"
" below, documentation that directs actions versus documentation that "
"describes what is the case. Left and right, documentation that serves "
"development of skill versus documentation that serves application of skill. "
"This gives us four kinds of documentation. Top left: learning-oriented "
"tutorials. Top right: goal-oriented how-to guides. Bottom right: "
"information-oriented reference. Bottom left: understanding-oriented "
"explanation."
msgstr ""
"这张地图以两条轴线为基准，划分成四个象限。纵向来看，代表了指导行动与陈述事实的文档之间的区别；横向来看，则是面向技能开发和技能运用的文档之间的区别。由此得出四种文档类型：左上为面向学习导向的教程，右上为目标导向的操作指南，右下为信息导向的参考，左下为理解导向的解释。"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:12
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "教程"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:13
msgid "How-to guides"
msgstr "操作指南"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:14
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考内容"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:15
msgid "Explanation"
msgstr "解释说明"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:17
msgid "Learning-oriented"
msgstr "学习导向"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:18
msgid "Goal-oriented"
msgstr "目标导向"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:19
msgid "Information-oriented"
msgstr "信息导向"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:20
msgid "Understanding-oriented"
msgstr "理解导向"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:22
msgid "Directs action"
msgstr "指导行动"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:23
msgid "Describes what is"
msgstr "陈述事实"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:24
msgid "Serves development of skill"
msgstr "面向技能开发"

#: ../../source/snippets/diagram.rst:25
msgid "Serves application of skill"
msgstr "面向技能运用"

#: ../../source/compass.rst:11
msgid ""
":doc:`The Diátaxis map <map>` is an effective reminder of the different "
"kinds of documentation and their relationship, and it accords well with "
"intuitions about documentation."
msgstr ":doc:`Diátaxis 地图 <map>` 能有效提醒我们注意文档有哪些不同类型、彼此关系如何，这与人们对于文档的直觉高度契合。"

#: ../../source/compass.rst:15
msgid ""
"However intuition is not always to be relied upon. Often when working with "
"documentation, an author is faced with the question: *what form of "
"documentation is this?* or *what form of documentation is needed here?* - "
"and no obvious, intuitive answer."
msgstr ""
"然而，直觉并非总是可靠的。在处理文档时，作者常常面临这样的问题：*这是哪种形式的文档？* 或者 *这里需要哪种形式的文档？* —— "
"却往往没有明显而直观的答案。"

#: ../../source/compass.rst:20
msgid ""
"Worse, sometimes intuition provides an immediate answer that is also wrong."
msgstr "更糟的是，有时直觉会立即给出答案，但却是错误的。"

#: ../../source/compass.rst:22
msgid ""
"A map is most powerful in unfamiliar territory when we also have a compass "
"to guide us."
msgstr "在陌生的领域中，当我们有指南针指引方向时，地图的效用最为显著。"

#: ../../source/compass.rst:25
msgid ""
"The Diátaxis compass is something like a truth-table or decision-tree of "
"documentation. It reduces a more complex, two-dimensional problem to its "
"simpler parts, and provides the author with a course-correction tool."
msgstr "Diátaxis 指南针类似于文档领域的真值表或决策树。它将更复杂的二维问题简化为更简单的组成部分，并为作者提供航向校正工具。"

